"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-part type collects part-wide information for each part in a score. Often, each MusicXML part"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponds to a track in a Standard MIDI Format 1 file. In this case, the midi-device element is used to make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a MIDI device or port assignment for the given track or specific MIDI instruments. Initial midi-instrument"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignments may be made here as well. The score-instrument elements are used when there are multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"instruments per track.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart","title":"MXLScorePart"}}}